      ],
      "text": "CLI commands include headless detached runs printing a run id, `watch` and `logs` for following runs, `runs`/`stop` for listing and stopping, `--resume` (never re-plans), `--continue` (always re-plans), `--doctor`, `login`, and `connect`."
    },
