      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dd7472e3865d3e2627d037be93f0cb650c62d8c00c061a55a488879457efe262"
      ],
      "text": "The tool requires Node 20+, git, and at least one LLM backend: the claude CLI (default), codex, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint; `baro --doctor` checks the setup."
    },
    {
