      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_826e5ab814899292fbc988d977c838373b712f0eea2138f4076df080a29c9735"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture is described as a Rust TUI host plus a TypeScript orchestrator whose bounded contexts communicate over the Mozaik event bus, with machine gates in front of every merge."
    },
