        "slc_ae87d5fc8640a00033bf1fee85c290f27d08dc21d425869ef73b8731a11d93c4"
      ],
      "text": "Goals are compiled by an architect into machine-checkable invariants before coding, split into a DAG of stories built in parallel across isolated git worktrees, with runtime replanning able to add and rewire stories mid-run and failed gates spawning remediation stories."
    },
