        "slc_ae87d5fc8640a00033bf1fee85c290f27d08dc21d425869ef73b8731a11d93c4"
      ],
      "text": "Merges are blocked behind fail-closed gates: declared tests, build-before-commit, an evidence critic judging captured command output, and write-surface ownership; the human reviews a PR the gates already accepted."
    },
