      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1b83cb6b8facc3914581a746d5644e1455cdc685bc83fc00a68575c8857ba45f"
      ],
      "text": "In collective mode, workers publish credential-free capabilities and bids, a broker grants a correlated lease to a deterministic winner, and with the Critic enabled a story passes only after the acceptance verdict plus StoryMerged, not merely when the model process exits."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6e0cee3d0ef9fb48d2a64af69932471fa3a2d75b324d2a606248af898c4b840f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc",
          "git_sha": "b48cf4ca47126a2d98f9ec005fea207b65650249",
          "line_end": 37,
          "line_start": 29,
          "path": "docs/collective-experiment.md",
          "repository": "jigjoy-ai/baro",
          "url": "https://github.com/jigjoy-ai/baro/blob/f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc/docs/collective-experiment.md#L29-L37"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_06fec732226659c52339156c5c61e151d72d99bf68ce96abed66dd1859229589"
      ],
      "text": "Runtime replan proposals carry run/story/lease/generation and a graphVersion; invalid, stale, cyclic, unauthorized, over-budget or non-durable candidates get a correlated rejection and are never shown as applied just because a model requested them."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_bb94c90bc24882cf73f385ce667a79ed9663f7f19767f5a5e236628239cba494",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc",
          "git_sha": "b5425bd631a98e80e5f33e553493c7ec29eb9157",
          "line_end": 53,
          "line_start": 47,
          "path": "docs/collective-runtime.md",
          "repository": "jigjoy-ai/baro",
          "url": "https://github.com/jigjoy-ai/baro/blob/f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc/docs/collective-runtime.md#L47-L53"
        }
