          "git_sha": "b48cf4ca47126a2d98f9ec005fea207b65650249",
          "line_end": 87,
          "line_start": 75,
          "path": "docs/collective-experiment.md",
          "repository": "jigjoy-ai/baro",
          "url": "https://github.com/jigjoy-ai/baro/blob/f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc/docs/collective-experiment.md#L75-L87"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_732b4135da596c72e2bb1c5651557fef0a5d8086d0d136536640b85670b29fe5"
      ],
      "text": "Proposal IDs act as idempotency keys: exact re-delivery returns the remembered decision without reapplying, reuse with different content is rejected, and applied decisions can be restored from the PRD's runtimeGraph metadata when a host resumes the same runId."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_630a3eb1b0633aa3bc1604d67ebf3a855db38c1a79fa35bfc09e1a9b75b7e73c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc",
          "git_sha": "b5425bd631a98e80e5f33e553493c7ec29eb9157",
          "line_end": 156,
          "line_start": 151,
          "path": "docs/collective-runtime.md",
          "repository": "jigjoy-ai/baro",
          "url": "https://github.com/jigjoy-ai/baro/blob/f9a610774532fdde578b656dd838766e1173c4fc/docs/collective-runtime.md#L151-L156"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_53030689d1df9ad77ddd431c81be4532239c3b0c4a387b25b9ab6f48f1f1521a"
      ],
      "text": "The runtime is distributed but not leaderless: the Board serializes scheduling and durable graph commits while separate participants own goal meaning, route selection, lease granting, quality evaluation, merging, and verification."
    },
